  "body": "Auction: Tues 3rd Nov (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLocated just a stroll from the beach and vibrant St Heliers village, this brick unit -one of just three-presents a fantastic opportunity to secure a home in a sought-after suburb.\r\n\r\nPreviously used as a lock-up-and-leave by owners based outside of Auckland, the property has been tastefully renovated to a high standard, making it pristine and ready for you to move in.\r\n\r\nThis sunny one-bedroom unit features a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area that opens onto a deck with elevated views. A lock-up garage also provides additional storage.\r\n\r\nSt Heliers beach, Glover Park and Churchill Park are all within easy walking distance, with popular local cafés and restaurants, and a dairy nearby, plus the wider amenities of St Heliers village and the beach  just down the road.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-home buyers, downsizers, or investors. Contact us today to ensure you don't miss out.",
